    <callActivity id="Id_7327edf7-d44d-4eaf-8278-dadd387f1416" name="SP3. Elaborar o ETP" calledElement="Id_cef38544-fb1b-45da-9ed6-3e4bbf275432">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Art. 6&amp;ordm; Para os fins desta Lei, consideram-se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XX - estudo t&amp;eacute;cnico preliminar: documento constitutivo da primeira etapa do planejamento de uma contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;oque caracteriza o interesse p&amp;uacute;blico envolvido e a sua melhor solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e d&amp;aacute; base ao anteprojeto, ao termo de refer&amp;ecirc;nciaou ao projeto b&amp;aacute;sico a serem elaborados caso se conclua pela viabilidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 18. A fase preparat&amp;oacute;ria do processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio &amp;eacute; caracterizada pelo planejamento e deve compatibilizar-se com o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual de que trata o inciso VII do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 desta Lei, sempre que elaborado, e com as leis or&amp;ccedil;ament&amp;aacute;rias, bem como abordar todas as considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es t&amp;eacute;cnicas, mercadol&amp;oacute;gicas e de gest&amp;atilde;o que podem interferir na contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, compreendidos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;I - a descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da necessidade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o fundamentada em estudo t&amp;eacute;cnico preliminar que caracterize o interesse p&amp;uacute;blico envolvido;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 19. Os &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;os da Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o com compet&amp;ecirc;ncias regulamentares relativas &amp;agrave;s atividades deadministra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de materiais, de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os e de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e contratos dever&amp;atilde;o:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - promover a ado&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o gradativa de tecnologias e processos integrados que permitam a cria&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, a utiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e aatualiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de modelos digitais de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os de engenharia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 3&amp;ordm; Nas licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os de engenharia e arquitetura, sempre que adequada ao objeto dalicita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, ser&amp;aacute; preferencialmente adotada a Modelagem da Informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da Constru&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;Building InformationModelling &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- BIM) ou tecnologias e processos integrados similares ou mais avan&amp;ccedil;ados que venham a substitu&amp;iacute;-la.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#C4BD97" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#746D47" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="runtimeProperties" value="{&quot;priority&quot;:0,&quot;asynchronousBehavior&quot;:{},&quot;subProcessType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;inputMappingType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;outputMappingType&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;exitMode&quot;:&quot;AllTokens&quot;}" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_7c8c05e9-1cd0-43ec-a61e-f65c3cd0b5f8</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_d468f7de-e8a8-4254-9261-e88de9335ac9</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_bd28ea44-0de1-4af6-b6d4-fb02850792ae">
        <dataOutput id="Id_ac7aa436-d1c2-4786-a3ec-7666d2e9a5f1">
          <documentation />
          <dataState id="Id_a9da6580-385d-47f8-b466-13a6c9a049e9" />
        </dataOutput>
        <inputSet id="Id_7b5af226-7b5c-40d5-b498-fad7a6c7b07d" />
        <outputSet id="Id_3564561e-503d-410c-b49f-bc99cad3fe71">
          <dataOutputRefs>Id_ac7aa436-d1c2-4786-a3ec-7666d2e9a5f1</dataOutputRefs>
        </outputSet>
      </ioSpecification>
      <dataOutputAssociation id="Id_233dffdd-c153-46b5-834d-9ff4bff9affb">
        <documentation />
        <sourceRef>Id_ac7aa436-d1c2-4786-a3ec-7666d2e9a5f1</sourceRef>
        <targetRef>Id_1e72d6f3-713b-4927-a8f4-581b305e117f</targetRef>
      </dataOutputAssociation>
      <resourceRole id="Id_f3457769-b525-40b4-86c7-01d8e4feb4c3">
        <q7:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q7="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Municipios</q7:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </callActivity>
    <callActivity id="Id_7eff5903-dcca-470c-908f-ec5da9462f65" name="SP5. Elaborar Termo de Referência" calledElement="Id_c37340f6-5a05-412e-8df4-c9af52df5dec">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Art. 6&amp;ordm; Para os fins desta Lei, consideram-se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XXIII - termo de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia: documento necess&amp;aacute;rio para a contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de bens e servi&amp;ccedil;os, que deve conter osseguintes par&amp;acirc;metros e elementos descritivos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) defini&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do objeto, inclu&amp;iacute;dos sua natureza, os quantitativos, o prazo do contrato e, se for o caso, apossibilidade de sua prorroga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) fundamenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, que consiste na refer&amp;ecirc;ncia aos estudos t&amp;eacute;cnicos preliminarescorrespondentes ou, quando n&amp;atilde;o for poss&amp;iacute;vel divulgar esses estudos, no extrato das partes que n&amp;atilde;o contivereminforma&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sigilosas;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o como um todo, considerado todo o ciclo de vida do objeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;d) requisitos da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;e) modelo de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do objeto, que consiste na defini&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de como o contrato dever&amp;aacute; produzir os resultadospretendidos desde o seu in&amp;iacute;cio at&amp;eacute; o seu encerramento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;f) modelo de gest&amp;atilde;o do contrato, que descreve como a execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do objeto ser&amp;aacute; acompanhada e fiscalizadapelo &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o ou entidade;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;g) crit&amp;eacute;rios de medi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e de pagamento;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;h) forma e crit&amp;eacute;rios de sele&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do fornecedor;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;i) estimativas do valor da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, acompanhadas dos pre&amp;ccedil;os unit&amp;aacute;rios referenciais, das mem&amp;oacute;rias dec&amp;aacute;lculo e dos documentos que lhe d&amp;atilde;o suporte, com os par&amp;acirc;metros utilizados para a obten&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos pre&amp;ccedil;os e para osrespectivos c&amp;aacute;lculos, que devem constar de documento separado e classificado;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;j) adequa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o or&amp;ccedil;ament&amp;aacute;ria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O Termo de Refer&amp;ecirc;ncia ganhou maior protagonismo ap&amp;oacute;s a consolida&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos modelos de minuta elaborados pela Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o P&amp;uacute;blica Federal, em que h&amp;aacute; clara op&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de se detalhar nele a pretens&amp;atilde;o da Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, com simples remiss&amp;atilde;o nos demais instrumentos, sem necessidade de replica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de seus termos. Assim, a sua elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de forma cautelosa e completa &amp;eacute; essencial para que todo o processo de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e fiscaliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do ajuste seja bem-sucedido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 19. Os &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;os da Administra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o com compet&amp;ecirc;ncias regulamentares relativas &amp;agrave;s atividades deadministra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de materiais, de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os e de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e contratos dever&amp;atilde;o:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;V - promover a ado&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o gradativa de tecnologias e processos integrados que permitam a cria&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, a utiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e aatualiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de modelos digitais de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os de engenharia.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;sect; 3&amp;ordm; Nas licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os de engenharia e arquitetura, sempre que adequada ao objeto dalicita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, ser&amp;aacute; preferencialmente adotada a Modelagem da Informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da Constru&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;Building InformationModelling &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;- BIM) ou tecnologias e processos integrados similares ou mais avan&amp;ccedil;ados que venham a substitu&amp;iacute;-la.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
